WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.700
A lawyer's desk by candlelight.

2
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:04.690
A will in an envelope.

3
00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:05.870
A letter.

4
00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:08.860
Two samples of handwriting
that look alike.

5
00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:12.450
A gloved hand picks up
each clue, studies it,

6
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.700
then locks it back in the safe.

7
00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:15.810
The lawyer is Mr.

8
00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:16.780
Utterson.

9
00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:18.740
He holds every clue.

10
00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:21.200
So why can't he solve the case?

11
00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:26.610
In this mission, you'll meet him: "cold,
scanty and embarrassed in discourse",

12
00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:29.080
and yet "somehow lovable".

13
00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:33.890
You'll hear his motto: "I let my
brother go to the devil in his own way."

14
00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:36.120
And you'll meet the gentlemen around him,

15
00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:39.550
a cousin, a doctor, a clerk and a butler,

16
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.280
and see what each one keeps quiet.

17
00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:46.370
Your mission: work out why
Utterson can't solve the case.
